WEBVTT

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.712
[THUDS]

00:00:58.739 --> 00:01:01.366
GINNY:
Who is that Hagrid's carrying?

00:01:02.034 --> 00:01:03.869
Neville, who is it?

00:01:04.536 --> 00:01:07.039
VOLDEMORT:
Harry Potter...

00:01:08.165 --> 00:01:09.791
...is dead.

00:01:09.833 --> 00:01:11.543
No! No!

00:01:11.585 --> 00:01:12.961
VOLDEMORT:
Silence.

00:01:16.631 --> 00:01:17.674
Stupid girl.

00:01:19.885 --> 00:01:23.472
Harry Potter is dead.

00:01:23.513 --> 00:01:28.769
From this day forth, you put your faith...

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:29.853
...in me.

00:01:40.363 --> 00:01:42.824
Harry Potter is dead!

00:01:42.866 --> 00:01:44.743
[ALL LAUGH]

00:01:47.537 --> 00:01:50.999
And now is the time to declare yourself.

00:01:52.542 --> 00:01:55.295
Come forward and join us.

00:01:57.214 --> 00:01:58.924
Or die.

00:02:04.471 --> 00:02:05.514
LUCIUS:
Draco.

00:02:11.186 --> 00:02:13.063
Draco.

00:02:15.941 --> 00:02:17.859
NARCISSA:
Draco...

00:02:20.695 --> 00:02:22.572
...come.

00:02:33.583 --> 00:02:37.003
VOLDEMORT:
Ah. Well done, Draco.

00:02:37.796 --> 00:02:39.673
Well done.

00:03:02.237 --> 00:03:05.115
Well, I must say I'd hoped for better.

00:03:05.157 --> 00:03:07.659
[VOLDEMORT'S FOLLOWERS LAUGH]

00:03:09.411 --> 00:03:12.289
And who might you be, young man?

00:03:13.582 --> 00:03:15.625
Neville Longbottom.

00:03:15.667 --> 00:03:17.460
[VOLDEMORT'S FOLLOWERS
LAUGHING]

00:03:20.797 --> 00:03:24.634
Well, Neville, I'm sure we can
find a place for you in our ranks.

00:03:24.676 --> 00:03:26.928
I'd like to say something.

00:03:33.059 --> 00:03:38.815
Well, Neville, I'm sure we'd all be fascinated
to hear what you have to say.

00:03:41.818 --> 00:03:44.446
-It doesn't matter Harry's gone.
-Stand down, Neville.

00:03:44.487 --> 00:03:47.115
People die every day.

00:03:48.783 --> 00:03:52.829
Friends, family.

00:03:54.873 --> 00:03:56.458
Yeah.

00:03:57.876 --> 00:04:00.045
We lost Harry tonight.

00:04:01.588 --> 00:04:06.092
But he's still with us, in here.

00:04:07.093 --> 00:04:09.012
So's Fred...

00:04:10.013 --> 00:04:11.806
...and Remus.

00:04:12.891 --> 00:04:14.226
Tonks.

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:17.479
All of them.

00:04:18.647 --> 00:04:20.899
They didn't die in vain.

00:04:26.029 --> 00:04:27.239
But you will.

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:29.783
-Because you're wrong.
-Ha-ha-ha.

00:04:29.824 --> 00:04:31.618
Harry's heart did beat for us.

00:04:32.035 --> 00:04:34.579
For all of us. This is not over!

00:04:36.373 --> 00:04:38.041
[HARRY GRUNTS]

00:04:38.708 --> 00:04:40.543
Confringo!

00:04:44.297 --> 00:04:45.757
[YELLING]

00:04:48.843 --> 00:04:50.512
BELLATRIX:
No! No, come back!

00:04:50.553 --> 00:04:54.641
Lucius! Come back! Come back and fight!

00:04:54.683 --> 00:04:56.726
Come back!

00:05:01.773 --> 00:05:05.068
I'll lure him into the castle.
We have to kill the snake.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:07.028
HERMIONE: You'll need this.
ARTHUR: Neville!

00:05:24.296 --> 00:05:25.922
[HISSING NEARBY]

00:05:35.348 --> 00:05:36.933
[WHOOSH]

